{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>上午10時許，西區薄扶林道64至68號景輝大廈住客發現一名女子倒臥平台，懷疑從高處墮下，警方及救援人員接報到場，證實女事主當場身亡。警方正調查事主身分。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T04:24:06.631934+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":76,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T03:49:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T04:17:21.914194+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T04:17:21.914194+00:00","content_hash":"6c7e0c00f6afb5b3e0c005d299a28a0db67ad21ad1ebf7314b06575e10021279","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}